# 戦女神ZERO's 設定, whose ﾒｯｾｰｼﾞ page has no wheel check (docs/engine-re.md, "戦女神ZERO's settings and 設定"): on
# SC0000's first page `options` lists the options, with no wheel-advance on either target, and three `option` steps
# set a control on the ﾒｯｾｰｼﾞ page, one on its Auto group and one on the ｻｳﾝﾄﾞ page. Natively AGERC's dialog, on the
# port the options panel.
#
# Compare SYS4REG.INI after `stop`: on a fresh sandbox the two targets write the same file byte for byte (2026-11-25),
# with MessageSpeed=30, AutoMessageTime0=900 and SE=0, and no AdvanceMesOnWheel or any other of the seven keys AGE
# 4.15D does not bind:
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py --game bg0 native|port start
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py --game bg0 native|port run tools/drive/scenarios/bg0-options.steps
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py --game bg0 native|port stop

rand-seed 13
wait-state script=OP timeout=120
wait 3
click adv.next                           # ends the opening movie
wait-state script=TITLE timeout=60
settle timeout=20
click title.start
wait-state script=BUNKI timeout=60       # the game-mode box (bg0-opening.steps)
settle timeout=20
click mode.normal
wait-state top=SC0000@0xec7 timeout=60   # page 1
settle timeout=20

options                                  # the sandbox's values: no wheel-advance
option message-speed 30
option auto-wait-voice 900
option se off
wait 1
options                                  # the values set above
expect top=SC0000@0xec7
